gui.drop.usage_desc=§7The default take settings and discard settings are stable values after testing. If there are any problems after modification, please restore the default values.
gui.drop.tip.mode=§eSwitch discard mode§r
gui.drop.tip.mode.1=§b Discard when opening the box: §r §7 Perform an item discard check after each box is opened.
gui.drop.tip.mode.2=§b Scheduled discarding: §r §7 Execute an item discarding check every set number of seconds.
gui.drop.tip.range=§eSwitch discard detection range§r
gui.drop.tip.range.1=§b Backpack + Box: §r §7 is discarded from the backpack first; only when the backpack has no items to discard, it is discarded from the box.
gui.drop.tip.range.2=§b Backpack only: §r §7 Only the items in the player's backpack are inspected and discarded, even if the chest is opened.
gui.drop.tip.batch=§eBatch Mode§r
gui.drop.tip.batch.1=§7 can handle multiple items at once when enabled.
gui.drop.tip.batch.2=§7 improves efficiency but may cause server stress.
gui.drop.tip.reset=§eRestore default§r
gui.drop.tip.reset.1=§7Restores all settings to recommended defaults.
